      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Old Key West is a spread-out Disney Vacation Club resort near Disney Springs, with a boat down the Sassagoula River. Deluxe Studios sleep four, with two queen beds; one-bedroom villas sleep five; two-bedroom villas sleep nine; Grand Villas sleep twelve. Olivia's Cafe is the table-service restaurant, and Sandcastle Pool is the main pool.</p>
