  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sandcastle Pool</strong> is the feature pool near Hospitality House: a 125-foot slide through a sandcastle, 149,600 gallons, a sand beach, a kiddie pool, a whirlpool spa and a dry sauna in the pool-deck lighthouse, per Disney's official pool page.</li>
      <li><strong>Three leisure pools</strong>, each with a whirlpool spa, are in the Old Turtle Pond, South Point and Miller's Road sections.</li>
    </ul>
